# Google Maps Platform API Key (Client-side Maps JavaScript API, Places API New, Elevation API)
#
# Quickstart for Prototyping (No billing account or Cloud project required):
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account and accept the Maps Demo Project Terms
# 3. Click to generate/reveal your free Maps Demo Key
# 4. Copy this file to .env.local and replace the placeholder below with your key:
#      cp .env.example .env.local
#
# For Production:
# Create a restricted API key in Google Cloud Console:
# https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Elevation API
# Restrict by HTTP referrer and API scope.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
